<task id="010" project="sdap-SPE-admin-app-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>SPIKE — prove the owning-app delegated path can obtain a Graph-audienced token</title>
    <phase>2 Workstream B — Resolve the auth model (GATED)</phase>
    <gate>startable — §6.5 ADR decision is on record (path C); this spike can REOPEN it</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Security-sensitive auth work; tags include auth. Root CLAUDE.md §6 escalation territory and §8 FULL trigger.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Architectural auth decision with an ADR gate attached. High blast radius: the outcome determines whether Workstream B proceeds as planned or the §6.5 gate reopens.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>W2</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>auth, oauth, authorization, bff-api, spike</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-8 hours</estimated-effort>
